This namelist advects a diagonal sinusoidal density wave through a periodic 3D domain.
The density varies from 1 to 2, while all velocity components and pressure are uniformly 1.
Compile the code with:
make NDIM=3 HYDRO=1 INIT=SINUS

To run the code:
bin/ramses3d namelist/sinus3d.nml

&RUN_PARAMS
hydro=.true.
nstepmax=10
ncontrol=1
/

&AMR_PARAMS
levelmin=6
levelmax=6
ngridmax=40000
nexpand=1
boxlen=1.0
/

&INIT_PARAMS
nregion=0
/

&OUTPUT_PARAMS
foutput=10
tout=1.0
/

&HYDRO_PARAMS
gamma=1.4
courant_factor=0.8
slope_type=2
riemann='hllc'
scheme='muscl'
/
